# Build-context excludes for the DSv4-Flash SFT delivery image (BuildKit reads
# this file when building with `-f docker/Dockerfile.dsv4_sft`; otherwise it
# falls back to the repo .dockerignore and the image just ends up larger).
#
# The big wins: the top-level .git (~233M) and the submodule object store under
# .git/modules/3rdparty/Megatron-LM (~113M) — neither is needed at runtime. The
# submodule WORKING TREE (3rdparty/Megatron-LM/megatron/...) is NOT under .git,
# so it is still copied.
.git
**/.git
.venv
venv
env
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
.cache
docs
.github
**/*.nemo
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
*.log
